      "text": "TRAFFIC ADVISORY\n\nIn connection with India vs West Indies 2nd Test cricket match at Arun Jaitley Stadium, 10–14 Oct 2025 | 09:00 HRS onwards\n\n📍 Affected Roads: JLN Marg (Rajghat → Delhi Gate), Asaf Ali Road (Turkman Gate → Delhi Gate), Bahadur Shah Zafar Marg (Delhi Gate → Ramcharan Aggarwal Chowk)\n📍 Traffic Restrictions: No heavy/commercial vehicles on Daryaganj → BSZ Marg & Guru Nanak Chowk → Asaf Ali Road\n📍 Stadium Entry: Gates 1–8 (South) via BSZ Marg , Gates 10–15 (East) via JLN Marg , Gates 16–18 (West) via BSZ Marg\n📍 Parking: Free – Mata Sundari Rd, Rajghat Power House Rd, Velodrome Rd , Labeled parking – P-1, P-2, P-3 only\n📍 Taxi Pick/Drop: Gate 2 (Maulana Azad Medical College), Rajghat Chowk\n📍 General Rules: No roadside parking on BSZ Marg, JLN Marg & Ring Road; violators will be towed\n📍 Stay updated via Delhi Traffic Police channels\n\n#DPTrafficAdvisory",
